Bootstrap: docker
From: ubuntu:24.04

%labels
    Author Geoffrey Weal
    Version 1.0.0
    Description "Simple Hello World Apptainer container"

%runscript
    echo "Hello World!"

%help
    This is a simple Apptainer "Hello World" container.

    Usage:
        apptainer run hello-world.sif

    What it does:
        Prints "Hello World!" to stdout.
